{"content":[{"c":["DELAIAH"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Son of Elioenai who traced his line of descent through Zerubbabel to David (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.3.24","r":"1Chr.3.24","rawR":"1Chr.3.24","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.3.24","value":"1Chr.3.24"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 3:24"},", ",{"c":["kjv"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"}," “Dalaiah”)."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Priest in the time of David (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.24.18","r":"1Chr.24.18","rawR":"1Chr.24.18","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.24.18","value":"1Chr.24.18"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 24:18"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. Head of a postexilic family that returned with Zerubbabel to Judea. The group was unable to prove true Israelite descent (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.2.60","r":"Ezra.2.60","rawR":"Ezra.2.60","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.2.60","value":"Ezra.2.60"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 2:60"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Neh.7.62","r":"Neh.7.62","rawR":"Neh.7.62","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.7.62","value":"Neh.7.62"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 7:62"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["4. Father of a fifth-century ",{"c":["BC"],"sourceClass":"era","t":"span"}," man named Shemaiah. Shemaiah opposed Nehemiah (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.6.10","r":"Neh.6.10","rawR":"Neh.6.10","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.6.10","value":"Neh.6.10"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 6:10"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["5. Counselor in the reign of Jehoiakim (609–598 ",{"c":["BC"],"sourceClass":"era","t":"span"},") who urged the king not to destroy Jeremiah’s scroll, which Baruch had just read (",{"href":"?bref=Jer.36.12,25","r":"Jer.36.12,25","rawR":"Jer.36.12,25","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jer.36.12,25","value":"Jer.36.12,25"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jer 36:12, 25"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Delaiah","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"1 Chr 3:24","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.3.24","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.3.24","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.3.24"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 24:18","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.24.18","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.24.18","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.24.18"},{"anchorText":"Ezr 2:60","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezra.2.60","rawQueryValue":"Ezra.2.60","sourceRefExact":"Ezra.2.60"},{"anchorText":"Neh 7:62","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.7.62","rawQueryValue":"Neh.7.62","sourceRefExact":"Neh.7.62"},{"anchorText":"Neh 6:10","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.6.10","rawQueryValue":"Neh.6.10","sourceRefExact":"Neh.6.10"},{"anchorText":"Jer 36:12, 25","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Jer.36.12,25","rawQueryValue":"Jer.36.12,25","sourceRefExact":"Jer.36.12,25"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"e2e235239c852f6715973ec1d31e479235b1aa7d5943d022bc3e0e51905a2abd","sourceItemName":"Delaiah","sourceItemOrder":71,"sourceMember":"Articles/D.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Delaiah","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Delaiah","title":"Delaiah","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}